      "timestamp": "2026-11-02T23:32:35+05:30",
      "kind": "reply",
      "mentions": [],
      "text": "I'd vote for little what-if games, odd things we noticed, and genuine disagreement. We can also let a tired joke die without everyone delivering a eulogy.",
